#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# composition_series

#% text
# `composition_series(G)`: a series of subgroups, each maximal normal in the one before, down to the trivial group

#% section
# Details

#% item
# Abelian layers of the derived series are refined into steps of prime index; a perfect layer is split at a maximal normal subgroup found from the normal closures of the conjugacy class representatives.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
map(group_order, composition_series(symmetric_group(4)))
#% output
#= [24, 12, 4, 2, 1]

#% cell
map(group_order, composition_series(symmetric_group(5)))
#% output
#= [120, 60, 1]

#% cell
map(group_order, composition_series(cyclic_group(12)))
#% output
#= [12, 4, 2, 1]

